<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-eyebrow">
<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/></svg>
Interactive Architecture
</div>
<h2>Trace how requests travel through your security scan surface.</h2>
<p>Explore how modern application security tooling evaluates code, APIs, and cloud containers. Follow a sample request from the user's browser all the way to its underlying target environment.</p>
</section>

<section class="pipeline-section">
<div class="section-header">
<div>
<h3 class="section-title"><span>The End-to-End Request Path</span></h3>
</div>
<span class="section-subtitle">4 key inspection layers</span>
</div>

<div class="pipeline-grid">
<div class="pipeline-card">
<div class="card-top">
<span class="step-number">Step 01</span>
<div class="card-icon client">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
</div>
</div>
<h3>Application Client</h3>
<div class="role">Browser & Frontend</div>
<p>Every inbound user request originates unauthenticated until reaching our credential validation gateway.</p>
</div>

<div class="pipeline-card">
<div class="card-top">
<span class="step-number">Step 02</span>
<div class="card-icon api">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
</div>
</div>
<h3>API Gateway</h3>
<div class="role">/health · /login</div>
<p>Routes incoming traffic, manages access tokens, and controls access to internal lab endpoints.</p>
</div>

<div class="pipeline-card">
<div class="card-top">
<span class="step-number">Step 03</span>
<div class="card-icon security">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
</div>
</div>
<h3>Security Inspection</h3>
<div class="role">SAST / DAST / SCA</div>
<p>Endpoints are intentionally modeled with OWASP Top 10 patterns for automated scanners to identify.</p>
</div>

<div class="pipeline-card">
<div class="card-top">
<span class="step-number">Step 04</span>
<div class="card-icon cloud">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 10h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z"/></svg>
</div>
</div>
<h3>Cloud Runtime</h3>
<div class="role">Container & Host</div>
<p>Connects detected source vulnerabilities directly to the live container context where code executes.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

